[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13806.309, "timestamp": "03:50:06", "text": "然而，我能夠以這種方式參與其中，這本身就是一種成就。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13808.83, "timestamp": "03:50:08", "text": "我真的很高興。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13813.309, "timestamp": "03:50:13", "text": "拯救世界是我祖國賦予我的真正使命。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13814.95, "timestamp": "03:50:14", "text": "蚊子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13819.349, "timestamp": "03:50:19", "text": "他們現在如何看待我？回憶"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13824.349, "timestamp": "03:50:24", "text": "即使我失去了它，我也會做出同樣的選擇。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13827.03, "timestamp": "03:50:27", "text": "真的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13829.79, "timestamp": "03:50:29", "text": "嘿，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13832.55, "timestamp": "03:50:32", "text": "我想和大家在一起。"}]